      "provenance": "ASSUMED. Astra-Global is described as a multimodal LLM (arXiv:2506.06205) but weights and serving cost are not published. Priced as a generic open-weight 7B-class VLM at commodity inference-provider rates (2026-11). Output tokens cost 3x input, the usual decode/prefill ratio.",
