      "name": "astra_local",
      "params_b": 0.15,
      "usd_per_mtok_in": 0.02,
      "usd_per_mtok_out": 0.02,
      "provenance": "ASSUMED. Astra-Local is a small multitask network with a 4D spatial-temporal encoder (arXiv:2506.06205); treated as a ~150M-param model. Cheap but not free, and it is called at every replan tick, so it is counted explicitly rather than dropped.",
      "usd_per_call": 0.0
    },
    "jev": {
      "name": "jev",
      "params_b": 2.0,
      "usd_per_mtok_in": 0.05,
      "usd_per_mtok_out": 0.0,
      "provenance": "ASSUMED, and the weakest assumption in the comparison. arXiv:2610.11692 states Jev answers all questions in a single forward pass and generates no tokens, so usd_per_mtok_out is set to 0 and only the prompt is charged. Size is a guess. Run scripts/sweep_pricing.py to find the break-even Jev price before claiming a cost reduction.",
      "usd_per_call": 0.0
    },
