      "name": "detector",
      "params_b": 0.1,
      "usd_per_mtok_in": 0.01,
      "usd_per_mtok_out": 0.0,
      "provenance": "ASSUMED. Stands in for the cheap open-vocabulary detector + proprioception that produces the coarse symbolic state Jev reads, since Jev takes text and not pixels. Charged on every hybrid decision tick so the hybrid is not credited with free perception.",
